-- 7020 -- Small Earth Elemental
#newmonster 7020
#spr1 "ForgottenRealms/elementalearthsmall.tga"
#spr2 "ForgottenRealms/elementalearthsmall2.tga"
#name "Small Earth Elemental"
#descr "Earth elementals were elementals formed from the element of earth. Extremely strong, they rarely left their home plane and like all elementals, they instinctively resented any creature that conjured them or bound them into service.

Earth elementals were capable of gliding through stone and dirt as though it were liquid, but only if they were unworked and non-magical. They were also capable of precisely pinpointing the location of nearby opponents, but only if they were standing on solid ground. They had perfect darkvision through this tremorsense. While Earth Elementals were immune to poison, they were vulnerable to acids.

These elementals had ichor flowing through their bodies, which could be used as a magical ingredient. Only the largest produced sufficnet ichor to be precipitated into a permanent form for later use, however. 

Like other elementals, they were often conjured in combat either through spellcraft or the use of powerful magic items. Spellcasters who had achieved mastery over the domain of the elemental's nature could also bind them to service as guardians - such guardian elementals could not travel far from the location to which they were bound, but made for exceptional and dedicated protectors." 
